====================================================================================================

ChatClientAgentRunOptions:

  ChatOptions
    Gets or sets the chat options to apply to the agent invocation.

  ChatClientFactory
    Gets or sets a factory function that can replace (typically via decorators) the chat client on a per


ChatOptions (passed via ChatClientAgentRunOptions.ChatOptions):

  ICollection<AITool>? Tools
    List of tools available to the agent

  string? Instructions
    Per-request instructions for the agent

  int? MaxOutputTokens
    Maximum tokens in response

  float? Temperature
    Sampling temperature (0-1)

  string? ModelId
    Specify which model to use

  bool? AllowMultipleToolCalls
    Allow multiple tools in one response

  ToolMode? ToolMode
    Control tool calling behavior

  IList<string>? StopSequences
    Stop generation at these sequences


NOTE: MaximumIterations is set via agent/context configuration,
not directly in ChatOptions. Check AgentRunOptions or ChatClientAgentOptions.

