====================================================================================================

CREATING A SESSION:

  AgentSession session = await agent.CreateSessionAsync(cancellationToken);
  // or for continuing existing conversation:
  AgentSession session = await agent.CreateSessionAsync(conversationId, cancellationToken);

ChatClientAgentSession Properties:

  string? ConversationId
    ID of the underlying service chat history

  string Id
    Unique session identifier

  ChatHistory ChatHistory
    Accumulated messages in this session

